{"title": "Mobile", "pageid": 21449, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Mobile", "categories": ["Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Dash.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/41/Dash.webp/300px-Dash.webp, /w/images/4/41/Dash.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/41/Dash.webp/300px-Dash.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/41/Dash.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Mobile</b> is a passive feature given by the <a href=\"/wiki/Feat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Feat\">feat</a> of the same name, which grants an additional 3m of <a href=\"/wiki/Movement_Speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Movement Speed\">Movement Speed</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Your movement speed increases by 3m. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the feats:\n<a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Mobile</a>\n</p>\n  <p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Dadger\" title=\"Dadger\">Dadger</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Erus\" title=\"Erus\">Erus</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Faona\" title=\"Faona\">Faona</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Galleass\" title=\"Galleass\">Galleass</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gurira\" title=\"Gurira\">Gurira</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Heen\" title=\"Heen\">Heen</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Helenia\" title=\"Helenia\">Helenia</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Jacko\" title=\"Jacko\">Jacko</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Loretta\" title=\"Loretta\">Loretta</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Morra\" title=\"Morra\">Morra</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Smathers\" title=\"Smathers\">Smathers</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Thamberg\" title=\"Thamberg\">Thamberg</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/The_Warden\" title=\"The Warden\">The Warden</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Theoda\" title=\"Theoda\">Theoda</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Triava\" title=\"Triava\">Triava</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Yonni\" title=\"Yonni\">Yonni</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>The feat <b>Mobile</b> also grants the passives <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mobile:_Evade_Difficult_Terrain\" title=\"Mobile: Evade Difficult Terrain\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Mobile_Evade_Difficult_Terrain_Icon.webp/25px-Mobile_Evade_Difficult_Terrain_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Mobile_Evade_Difficult_Terrain_Icon.webp/38px-Mobile_Evade_Difficult_Terrain_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Mobile_Evade_Difficult_Terrain_Icon.webp/50px-Mobile_Evade_Difficult_Terrain_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mobile: Evade Difficult Terrain\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Mobile_Evade_Difficult_Terrain_Icon.webp/25px-Mobile_Evade_Difficult_Terrain_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Mobile_Evade_Difficult_Terrain_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mobile:_Evade_Difficult_Terrain\" title=\"Mobile: Evade Difficult Terrain\">Mobile: Evade Difficult Terrain</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mobile:_Evade_Opportunity_Attack\" title=\"Mobile: Evade Opportunity Attack\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/06/Mobile_Evade_Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp/25px-Mobile_Evade_Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/06/Mobile_Evade_Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp/38px-Mobile_Evade_Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/06/Mobile_Evade_Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp/50px-Mobile_Evade_Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mobile: Evade Opportunity Attack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/06/Mobile_Evade_Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp/25px-Mobile_Evade_Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/06/Mobile_Evade_Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mobile:_Evade_Opportunity_Attack\" title=\"Mobile: Evade Opportunity Attack\">Mobile: Evade Opportunity Attack</a></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195823\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.032 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.036 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 893/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 6790/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3349/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 19/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 898/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 761300/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   30.982      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   30.982      1 -total\n 19.43%    6.019      2 Template:SAI\n 16.82%    5.211      2 Template:Icon_link\n 15.53%    4.813      2 Template:Icon_text\n 13.60%    4.213      1 Template:PageSeo\n 12.62%    3.909      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 12.46%    3.861      1 Template:Passive_creatures_list\n 11.00%    3.408      4 Template:Trim\n 10.37%    3.212      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser